{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7667165034336340229","title":"营销Agent产品 - 剪映CapCut","description":"团队介绍：剪映CapCut团队成立七年，先后孵化了剪映、CapCut、醒图、Hypic、即梦、Dreamina、Pippit等产品，覆盖视频、图片、Al生成、视频营销等多领域，打造与AI结合的全球化产品矩阵。\n我们的愿景是：激发想象力，成为全球领先的互动内容平台，创造独特的体验和价值。\n我们期待你的加入，一同极致打磨用户体验,构建创意生态和商业化能力，定义AI与创作结合的无限可能，让内容互动更简单、更精彩!\n\n1、Agent产品交互设计：负责小云雀Pippit营销Agent的产品方案设计，定义人机协同（Human-Agent Interaction）的创新交互模式；\n2、分析营销内容创作场景痛点，制定交互解决方案并推动落地；\n3、Agent产品链路设计：负责小云雀Pippit营销Agent的后链路迭代，包括不限于增加用户选择的库、迭代内容创作的基本工作流。","requirement":"1、2027届获得本科及以上学历；\n2、具备职场成熟度，拥有快速学习及问题解决能力；\n3、具备内容审美能力，基本了解营销/广告/电商的内容特性；\n4、了解Agent链路，对基础模型能力有认知，具备Harness工程实践经验。","job_category":{"id":"6704215864629004552","name":"产品","en_name":"Product","i18n_name":"产品","depth":1,"children":[]},"city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1785151050585,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7649336829398468869","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘","i18n":"2027届校园招聘"},"active_status":1},"code":"A233388A","job_id":"7667163400091748661","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]